 "labelling_rule": "A1..A9 in descending order of changed account-days at the 1e-12 floor (|variant - baseline| of the daily return, account-days measured in both builds), ties by earliest first changed date. Mapping kept in scratch only. trade_days = distinct changed dates on which the account has a share-moving transaction row (custodian type codes) in any moved fund held on that date; kinds: purchases={by}; sales={sl}; reinvestments={dvr, DVRX, ci}; transfers={trfi, TRFIR, trci, TRCISU, trfo, trco, li, LISU, lo}; corporate_action_or_qa_other={lica, licar, LICASU, loca, QA}; trade_days_by_kind counts distinct dates per kind so a date can sit in two kinds; trade_days is the distinct-date count across kinds. Bands: under 1bp <0.0001; 1-10bp 0.0001..0.001 inclusive; over 10bp >0.001. share_changed = changed_account_days / account's measured days in the baseline (non-null return).",
 "headline": "1,577 changed account-days (1,575 at 1e-9) on 554 dates sit in 9 accounts; 7 of the 9 hold a single moved fund on every changed day (FCNTX in 5, BALCX in 2; A1 and A9 hold two). The top 3 labels carry 48.38% of the changes and the top 1 carries 51.04% of the 96 changes over 10 bp. Of 377 accounts that hold one of the moved funds on some day, 10 have a measured day on a held day and 367 have none: nine is small because few holders are measured (9 of 10 change), not because the defect is small. 5 of the 19 funds (ANCFX, BALCX, CAIBX, CWGIX, FCNTX) carry a measured holder.",
